{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"对称群"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"对称群"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>给定自然数 $n$, <strong>对称群</strong> $S_n$ 是 $n$ 元集合的自同构"},{"Local":{"url":"群","text":"群"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"对称群的表示","text":"对称群的表示"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}